{"2433670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Deep Loop", "steam_appid": 2433670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the maze of your mind to find your way to the seven deadly sins. Each door is an opportunity to move forward or backward, but you must face them to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/e261e6cbd5b039689d1360667410630e.poster.avif?t=1762261949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/e261e6cbd5b039689d1360667410630e.webm?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/e261e6cbd5b039689d1360667410630e.mp4?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Diversity of mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On your journey you will find all sorts of mechanics and game modes, from first-person to fixed camera or cinematic. The variety of actions available will allow you to experience each of the sins you encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/727fa46a3c25c7ba2944a8788783d2bb.poster.avif?t=1762261949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/727fa46a3c25c7ba2944a8788783d2bb.webm?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/727fa46a3c25c7ba2944a8788783d2bb.mp4?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Action and Adventure</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the puzzles you encounter and don't hesitate to use the weapons at your disposal if necessary.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on your sin, you may be able to control more than one character at a time, but keep in mind that death can be permanent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/977bb2ba1a77067e57698cf38185ab89.poster.avif?t=1762261949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/977bb2ba1a77067e57698cf38185ab89.webm?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/977bb2ba1a77067e57698cf38185ab89.mp4?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the maze of your mind to find your way to the seven deadly sins. Each door is an opportunity to move forward or backward, but you must face them to proceed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/e261e6cbd5b039689d1360667410630e.poster.avif?t=1762261949\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/e261e6cbd5b039689d1360667410630e.webm?t=1762261949\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433670/extras/e261e6cbd5b039689d1360667410630e.mp4?t=1762261949\" typ